<http://purl.org/spar/fr/issuedFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The realation between a review and the entity (e.g. conference, journal) that it was issued for (usually the one that requested the review)."@en .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/issuedFor> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/issuedFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "issued for"@en .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/issuedFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/spar/fr/ConveningOrganization> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/issuedFor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/spar/fr/issuedFor> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n	:my-review a fabio:Review ;\n		frbr:realization :my-review-version ;\n		fr:issuedFor :my-convening-organization .\n\n	:my-convening-organization a fr:ConveningOrganization .\n    " .
